"/us/en/emergency-care/products/power-pro-2": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"Power-PRO 2 powered ambulance cot","pageTitle":"Power-PRO 2 Powered Ambulance Cot","description":"Lift, lower and transport with confidence. Power-PRO 2 is the first connected ambulance cot, built for the relentless workload of emergency response.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/ems/products/power-pro-2/images/Thumbnail_Power-PRO_2_307x184.jpg","imageAlt":"Power-PRO 2","tags":["stryker:product/ems","stryker:content-type/product","stryker:specialty/caregiver-safety","stryker:capability/emergency-medical-equipment","stryker:specialty/hybrid-system","stryker:business-unit/ems","stryker:custom/ems/product-type/cots","stryker:portfolio/medical-and-surgical-equipment","stryker:product/ems/power-pro-2","stryker:specialty/powered-system","stryker:services/procare/ems","stryker:content-type/hcp_content"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T15:03:40.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-10-01T16:36:01.000Z","contentID":"EC-PP2-SYK-3707550_REV-0_en_us "},"anchors":[{"id":"features","title":"Features","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"mini-pro","title":null,"hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"connect","title":"Connect","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"resources","title":"Resources","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"}],"disclaimer":"<p>1. Maguire, B. J., Al Amiry, A., &amp; O'Neill, B. J. (2023). Occupational injuries and illnesses among paramedicine clinicians: Analyses of US Department of Labor data (2010–2020). <i>Prehospital and Disaster Medicine, 38</i>(5), 581–588. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1017/S1049023X23006118\">https://doi.org/10.1017/S1049023X23006118</a></p>\r\n<p>2. Prairie, J., Plamondon, A., Hegg-Deloye, S., Larouche, D., &amp; Corbeil, P. (2016). Biomechanical risk assessment during field loading of hydraulic stretchers into ambulances. <i>International Journal of Industrial Ergonomics, 54</i>, 1–9. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ergon.2015.11.014\">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ergon.2015.11.014</a></p>\r\n<p>3. Armstrong, D. P., Ferron, R., Taylor, C., McLeod, B., Fletcher, S., MacPhee, R. S., &amp; Fischer, S. L. (2017). Implementing powered stretcher and load systems was a cost effective intervention to reduce the incidence rates of stretcher related injuries in a paramedic service. <i>Applied Ergonomics, 62</i>, 34–42. <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apergo.2017.02.009\">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apergo.2017.02.009</a></p>\r\n<p>4. Statistics and statements gathered from employees of several different EMS services across the United States via survey from 2015 to 2019. The views and opinions expressed herein are those of the survey respondents. Percentages include “Strongly Agree” and “Agree” responses combined and are rounded to the nearest whole percentage. Data on file.</p>","forms":[{"formId":"1322","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thanks!","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[["Product information","Related products"]],"cardLists":[{"component":"customizable_copy_co","title":"Related products","items":[{"path":"/us/en/emergency-care/products/lifepak-35","resolved":true,"title":"LIFEPAK 35 monitor/defibrillator","description":"The LIFEPAK 35 monitor/defibrillator for hospitals and EMS is a future-ready device designed to promote confident cardiac care, enable clinical excellence and deliver in demanding environments.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/ems/products/lifepak-35/images/LIFEPAK-35-Hero-angled-left_1200x680.jpg","alt":"LIFEPAK 35 monitor/defibrillator for hospital and EMS"},{"path":"/us/en/emergency-care/products/xpedition-powered-stair-chair","resolved":true,"title":"Xpedition powered stair chair","description":"Xpedition, Stryker's first powered stair chair, has uniquely designed features to help decrease your effort while transporting patients and increase your patients' comfort – because the journey is just as important as the destination.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/ems/products/xpedition/images/Thumbnail_Xpedition_307x184_Transparent.png","alt":"Xpedition powered patient transport chair "},{"path":"/us/en/emergency-care/products/lucas-3","resolved":true,"title":"LUCAS 3, v3.1 chest compression system","description":"Deliver high-performance, continuous chest compressions.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/ems/products/lucas-3/Lucas_3_2.jpg","alt":"Automatic CPR machine - LUCAS 3, v3.1 chest compression system"},{"path":"/us/en/emergency-care/products/power-load","resolved":true,"title":"Power-LOAD","description":"Our Power-LOAD cot fastener improves operator and patient safety by supporting the cot throughout the loading and unloading process.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/ems/products/power-load/images/Thumbnail_Power_LOAD.jpg","alt":"Power-LOAD"}]}],"missingAlt":[]},
