"/us/en/emergency-care/products/xpr-restraints": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"XPR Restraints","pageTitle":"XPR Restraints","description":null,"image":"/content/dam/stryker/ems/products/xpr-restraints/images/xpr-cleanability-_0000_XPR PP image2.jpg","imageAlt":"XPR Restraints","tags":["stryker:product/ems","stryker:content-type/product","stryker:specialty/hybrid-system","stryker:capability/emergency-medical-equipment","stryker:business-unit/ems","stryker:portfolio/medical-and-surgical-equipment","stryker:services/procare","stryker:capability/emergency-patient-transport","stryker:specialty/powered-system","stryker:content-type/hcp_content"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T15:26:36.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-08-20T15:26:36.000Z","contentID":" M0000006519 REV AA"},"anchors":[{"id":"features","title":"Features","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"connect","title":"Connect","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"resources","title":"Resources","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"}],"disclaimer":"<p>1. Meets SAE J3027 and BS EN 1789:2020 dynamic crash standards in combination with Power-LOAD and Power-PRO XT, Power-PRO TL or Performance-PRO XT.<br>\r\n2. When power washed within cot system.<br>\r\n3. Compared to traditional nylon restraints.</p>\r\n<p>This document is intended solely for the use of healthcare professionals.</p>\r\n<p>A healthcare professional must always rely on his or her own professional clinical judgment when deciding whether to use a particular product when treating a particular patient.&nbsp;Stryker does not dispense medical advice and recommends that healthcare professionals be appropriately trained in the use of any particular product before use.</p>\r\n<p>The information presented is intended to demonstrate the breadth of Stryker product offerings. A healthcare professional must always refer to the package insert, product label and/or&nbsp;Instructions for Use before using any Stryker product.</p>\r\n<p>Products may not be available in all markets because product availability is subject to the regulatory and/or medical practices in individual markets. Please contact your Stryker&nbsp;representative if you have questions about the availability of Stryker products in your area.</p>\r\n<p>Stryker or its affiliated entities own, use, or have applied for the following trademarks or service marks: Performance-PRO, Power-PRO, Stryker, XPR. All other trademarks are&nbsp;trademarks of their respective owners or holders. The absence of a product, feature, or service name, or logo from this list does not constitute a waiver of Stryker’s trademark or other&nbsp;intellectual property rights concerning that name or logo.</p>","forms":[{"formId":"1322","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thanks!","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[["Product information","Related products"]],"cardLists":[{"component":"customizable_copy","title":null,"items":[{"path":"/us/en/emergency-care/products/power-pro-2","resolved":true,"title":"Power-PRO 2 powered ambulance cot","description":"Lift, lower and transport with confidence. Power-PRO 2 is the first connected ambulance cot, built for the relentless workload of emergency response.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/ems/products/power-pro-2/images/Thumbnail_Power-PRO_2_307x184.jpg","alt":"Power-PRO 2"},{"path":"/us/en/emergency-care/products/power-pro-xt","resolved":false},{"path":"/us/en/emergency-care/products/performance-pro-xt","resolved":true,"title":"Performance-PRO XT","description":"Our Performance-PRO XT manual cot has a 700 lb. weight capacity and a retractable head section for 360-degree mobility in any height position.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/ems/products/performance-proxt/images/Thumbnail_performance_PRO.jpg","alt":"Performance-PRO Manual Ambulance Cot"}]}],"missingAlt":[]},
