"/us/en/foot-and-ankle/products/Incompass": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"Incompass","pageTitle":"Incompass","description":null,"image":"/content/dam/stryker/foot-and-ankle/products/incompass/images/S06-10-Incompass-4withPoly-web.png","imageAlt":"Incompass Total Ankle System","tags":["stryker:content-type/product","stryker:content-type/hcp_content"],"originallyPublished":"2025-08-27T18:00:10.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-07-29T18:43:36.000Z","contentID":"FA-INCO-SYK-2216762_REV-0_en_us"},"anchors":[{"id":"contact","title":"Contact","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"contact-us","title":"contact-us","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"}],"disclaimer":"<p>References</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Based on internal data as of 5/1/2025.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Data on file at Stryker. Claim based on data from rabbit femur model. It is unknown how these results compare with clinical results in humans&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Gagne OJ, Day J. Kim J, Caolo K, O’Malley MJ, Deland JT, Ellis SJ, Demetracopoulos CA. Midterm Survivorship of the INBONE II Total Ankle Arthroplasty. Foot &amp; Ankle International. 2022 May;43(5):628-636. doi: 10.1177/10711007211060047&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Early experience and patient-reported outcomes of 503 Infinity total ankle arthroplasties: A Concise Follow Up Townshend et al.| Oct 2023 | The Bone &amp; Joint Journal | Vol. 103-B, No.</li>\r\n<li>Compared to legacy Stryker Total Ankle System’s Infinity and Inbone.</li>\r\n</ol>","forms":[{"formId":"3079","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you!","useProduction":true},{"formId":"1079","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you!","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
