"/us/en/foot-and-ankle/products/inbone": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"Inbone","pageTitle":"Inbone","description":"Stryker (Wright Medical)— The Inbone Total Ankle System is a modular prosthesis installed via the first and only intramedullary alignment system. Since its inception in 2005, the Inbone Total Ankle System has continued to be the most distinctive and innovative total ankle replacement system on the market. ","image":"/content/dam/stryker/foot-and-ankle/products/inbone/HERO_INBONE II EVERLAST.png","imageAlt":"Inbone Total Ankle System","tags":["stryker:content-type/product","stryker:procedure/foot-and-ankle/total-ankle-replacement/total-ankle-replacements","stryker:business-unit/foot-and-ankle","stryker:procedure/foot-and-ankle/total-ankle-replacement","stryker:specialty/ankle-foot-and-ankle","stryker:capability/foot-and-ankle","stryker:content-type/hcp_content"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T16:47:49.000Z","lastPublished":"2025-03-24T20:00:13.000Z","contentID":"AP-017711"},"anchors":[{"id":"about","title":"about","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"testlink","title":" TESTLINK","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"specification","title":"specification","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"testlink","title":" TESTLINK","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"contact","title":"contact","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"}],"disclaimer":"<p><b>&nbsp;References</b></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Based on publicly available information as of October 1, 2024.</li>\r\n<li>Hsu AR, Haddad SL. Early clinical and radiographic outcomes of intramedullary-ﬁxation total ankle arthroplasty. J Bone Joint Surg Am. Feb 4 2015;97(3):194-200.</li>\r\n<li>Gagne OJ, Day J, Kim J, et al. Midterm Survivorship of the Inbone II Total Ankle Arthroplasty. Foot &amp; Ankle International. 2022;43(5):628-636. doi:10.1177/10711007211060047</li>\r\n</ol>","forms":[{"formId":"3079","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you!","useProduction":true},{"formId":"1079","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you!","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
"/us/en/foot-and-ankle/products/infinity": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"Infinity Total Ankle System","pageTitle":"Infinity Total Ankle System","description":"The Infinity® Total Ankle System consists of a titanium alloy tibial tray, cobalt chromium talar dome, and a polyethylene insert. Approaching 10 years of international clinical use, Infinity has become one of the most widely used1 low-profile prosthesis solutions for surgeons treating End Stage Ankle Arthritis (ESAA). Wright Medical - Stryker","image":"/content/dam/stryker/foot-and-ankle/products/all-products/2024-brandrefresh/product-thumbnails/Thumb-Infinity.png","imageAlt":"Infinity Total Ankle System","tags":["stryker:product/foot-and-ankle","stryker:content-type/product","stryker:business-unit/foot-and-ankle","stryker:specialty/ankle-foot-and-ankle","stryker:capability/foot-and-ankle","stryker:product/foot-and-ankle/infinity","stryker:content-type/hcp_content","stryker:custom/foot-and-ankle/product-type/total-ankle-replacement","stryker:procedure/foot-and-ankle/total-ankle-replacement/total-ankle-replacements"],"originallyPublished":"2024-10-11T20:12:26.000Z","lastPublished":"2024-10-11T20:12:26.000Z","contentID":"AP-017646"},"anchors":[{"id":"about","title":"about","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"specification","title":"specification","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"testlink","title":" TESTLINK","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"testlink","title":" TESTLINK","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"testlink","title":" TESTLINK","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"testlink","title":" TESTLINK","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"testlink","title":" TESTLINK","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"contact","title":"contact","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"}],"disclaimer":"<p><b>References</b></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Based on SmartTrak Data as of 2023</li>\r\n<li>Based on&nbsp;UK NJR Annual Report 2023</li>\r\n<li>Based on internal sales data</li>\r\n<li>Based on countries where Infinity is approved by the governing regulatory body</li>\r\n<li>Townshend D, Bing A, Blundell C, Clough T, Davenport J, Davies H, Davis J, Dhar S, Hepple S, Kakwani R, Karski M, Makwana N, McKinley J, Murty A, Raglan M, Shalaby H, Sharpe I, Smith R, Taylor H, Goldberg A. Two to Five-Year Outcomes of Total Ankle Arthroplasty with the Infinity Fixed-Bearing Implant: A Concise Follow-up of a Previous Report. J Bone Joint Surg Am. 2023 Dec 6;105(23):1846-1856. doi: 10.2106/JBJS.22.01294. Epub 2023 Oct 16. PMID: 38063779; PMCID: PMC10695343.</li>\r\n<li>Data on file at Stryker. Claim based on data from rabbit femure model. It is unknown how these results compare with clinical results in humans.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Zhang Y, Ahn PB, Fitzpatrick DC, Heiner A, Poggie RA, Brown TD, Interfacial frictional behavior; cancellous bone, cortical bone, and a novel porous tantalum biomaterial. Journal Musculoskeletal Research 1999.</li>\r\n<li>When compared to Stryker traditional ankle UHMWPE poly inserts through bench top testing according to ISO 22622. Data on file.</li>\r\n</ol>","forms":[{"formId":"3079","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you!","useProduction":true},{"formId":"1079","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you!","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
