"/us/en/neurovascular/products/trevo--xp-provue-retriever-": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"Trevo XP ","pageTitle":"Trevo XP ","description":"The Trevo XP ProVue Retrievers are fully visible and designed specifically for removing a thrombus in patients experiencing an ischemic stroke.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-xp-provue-retriever-/images/Thumbnail_Trevo XP ProVue.jpg","imageAlt":"Trevo XP","tags":["stryker:content-type/product","stryker:portfolio/neurotechnology","stryker:business-unit/neurovascular","stryker:product/neurovascular/trevo-xp-provue-retriever","stryker:capability/neurovascular","stryker:content-type/hcp_content","stryker:specialty/thrombectomy","stryker:specialty/acute-ischemic-stroke-ais"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T16:51:12.000Z","lastPublished":"2025-01-08T16:51:12.000Z","contentID":"AP001666 v2.0"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":null,"forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
"/us/en/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"Trevo NXT","pageTitle":null,"description":"Take thrombectomy to the next level","image":"/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt/images/TrevoNXT_no ring.png","imageAlt":"Trevo NXT","tags":["stryker:content-type/product","stryker:product/neurovascular/trevo-nxt","stryker:portfolio/neurotechnology","stryker:business-unit/neurovascular","stryker:capability/neurovascular","stryker:content-type/hcp_content","stryker:specialty/thrombectomy","stryker:specialty/acute-ischemic-stroke-ais"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T16:51:12.000Z","lastPublished":"2025-01-08T16:51:12.000Z","contentID":"AP003125 v2.0"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p>1. MERCI Multi Merci listed by study enrollment dates. Smith, Wade S., et al. “Mechanical Thrombectomy for Acute Ischemic Stroke.” Stroke, vol. 39, 28 Feb. 2008, pp. 1205–1212,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1161/strokeaha.107.497115\">https://doi.org/10.1161/strokeaha.107.497115</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. MERCI Registry listed by study enrollment dates. “Merci Registry - Real World Use of the Merci Retrieval System in Acute Ischemic Stroke - Full Text View.”&nbsp;ClinicalTrials.Gov, 24 May 2007,&nbsp;classic.clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/study/NCT00478478.</p>\r\n<p>3. TREVO listed by study enrollment dates. Jansen, Olav, et al. “Neurothrombectomy for the Treatment of Acute Ischemic Stroke: Results from the Trevo Study.” Cerebrovascular Diseases, vol. 36, no. 3, 12 Oct. 2013, pp. 218–225,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1159/000353990\">https://doi.org/10.1159/000353990</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. TREVO 2 listed by study enrollment dates. Nogueira, Raul G, et al. “Trevo versus Merci Retrievers for Thrombectomy Revascularisation of Large Vessel Occlusions in Acute Ischaemic Stroke (TREVO 2): A Randomised Trial.” The Lancet, vol. 380, no. 9849, 26 Aug. 2012, pp. 1231–1240,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/s0140-6736(12)61299-9\">https://doi.org/10.1016/s0140-6736(12)61299-9</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. MR CLEAN listed by study enrollment dates. Berkhemer, Olvert A., et al. “A Randomized Trial of Intraarterial Treatment for Acute Ischemic Stroke.” New England Journal of Medicine, vol. 372, 1 Jan. 2015, pp. 11–20,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1056/nejmoa1411587\">https://doi.org/10.1056/nejmoa1411587</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. TRACK Registry listed by study enrollment dates. Zaidat, Osama O, et al. “Trevo Stent-Retriever Mechanical Thrombectomy for Acute Ischemic Stroke Secondary to Large Vessel Occlusion Registry.” Journal of NeuroInterventional Surgery, vol. 10, no. 6, 29 Sept. 2017, pp. 516–524,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1136/neurintsurg-2017-013328\">https://doi.org/10.1136/neurintsurg-2017-013328</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. DAWN Trial listed by study enrollment dates. Nogueira, Raul G., Ashutosh P. Jadhav, et al. “Thrombectomy 6 to 24 Hours after Stroke with a Mismatch between Deficit and Infarct.” New England Journal of Medicine, vol. 378, 4 Jan. 2018, pp. 11–21,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1056/nejmoa1706442\">https://doi.org/10.1056/nejmoa1706442</a>.</p>\r\n<p>8. Trevo Registry aka Trevo 2000 Registry listed by study enrollment dates. Binning, Mandy J., et al. “Trevo 2000: Results of a Large real‐World Registry for Stent Retriever for Acute Ischemic Stroke.” Journal of the American Heart Association, vol. 7, no. 24, 18 Dec. 2018,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1161/jaha.118.010867\">https://doi.org/10.1161/jaha.118.010867</a>.</p>\r\n<p>9. ASSIST Registry listed by completion date, defined here as date that final data were received by Stryker. Data on file.</p>\r\n<p>10. Information about Trevo China, Trevo Japan, and ongoing investigator initiated studies on file at Stryker.</p>\r\n<p>11. Elderly stroke patients: Pizzo et al. Cost-utility Analysis of Mechanical Thrombectomy Between 6 and 24 Hours in Acute Ischemic Stroke. International Journal of Stroke. January 2020.</p>\r\n<p>12. Elderly stroke patients: Kunz et al. Cost-effectiveness of Endovascular Therapy for acute Ischemic Stroke: A Systematic Review of the Impact of Patient Age. Radiology. August 2018.</p>\r\n<p>Stryker or its affiliated entities own, use, or have applied for the following trademarks or service marks: Stryker, Trevo NXT, TriGlide. All other trademarks are trademarks of their respective owners or holders.</p>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":["/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt/images/Small_Icon4-Guide.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt/images/Small_Icon4_4in1.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trak-21/images/Small_Icon3.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt/images/Bar_Graph_V2.png","/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt/images/Updated_Bar_Graph.png","/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt/images/Technique_Image-01.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt/images/LengthsGuide.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/axs-vecta-intermediate-catheter/images/Combination_Graphic_V2.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/neurovascular/products/trevo-nxt/images/Combination_Graphic_V3.jpg"]},
