"/us/en/orthopaedic-instruments/products/blu62-pretreatment-foam-and-instrument-detergent": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"Blu62","pageTitle":"Blu62","description":"Blu62 Pretreatment Foam and Instrument Detergent aim to take the effort out of washing. As non-enzymatic cleaners, they're less dependent on contact time, water type or temperature - meaning less details or sink changes for you to manage.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/surgical/products/blu62/images/Thumbnail_Blu62.jpg","imageAlt":null,"tags":["stryker:content-type/product","stryker:portfolio/medical-and-surgical-equipment","stryker:capability/sterile-processing","stryker:capability/cleaners-and-disinfectants","stryker:services/procare/surgical","stryker:specialty/cleaners-and-detergents","stryker:content-type/hcp_content","stryker:business-unit/orthopaedic_instruments","stryker:product/orthopaedic_instruments/Blu62"],"originallyPublished":null,"lastPublished":"2021-04-19T18:13:28.000Z","contentID":"D0000004099 Rev. AA"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p>1. ProClean white paper. &quot;ProClean adds value to any powered equipment account.&quot; Stryker Instruments, 2012.</p>\r\n<p>2. Association for the Advancement of Medical Instrumentation (AAMI). &quot;Comprehensive guide to steam sterilization\r\nand sterility assurance in health care facilities.&quot; ST 79, section 6/4. 2010\r\n</p>\r\n<p>3. Association of Perioperative Nurses (AORN). &quot;Guidelines for sterilization and disinfection.&quot; Section III.G. 2017. </p>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":["/content/dam/stryker/surgical/products/blu62/images/Blu62 Study Results2.jpg"]},
"/us/en/orthopaedic-instruments/products/blu62-pretreatment-foam-and-instrument-detergent/speed-spray62": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"Speed Spray62","pageTitle":"Speed Spray62","description":"Speed Spray62 pretreatment foam dispenser is made for point of use application, replacing the need for aerosol spray bottles. The Speed Spray62 dispenser delivers pretreatment quickly and effectively to provide better overall coverage, treating an entire tray of instruments in seconds. The Speed Spray62 dispenser can be mounted on a wall, or for more mobility, attached to an IV pole, and comes equipped with two wand application systems.\r\n","image":"/content/dam/stryker/orthopaedic-instruments/products/speedspray62/images/Thumbnail.jpg","imageAlt":null,"tags":["stryker:content-type/product","stryker:business-unit/orthopaedic_instruments","stryker:portfolio/medical-and-surgical-equipment","stryker:services/procare","stryker:capability/sterile-processing","stryker:capability/cleaners-and-disinfectants","stryker:procedure/orthopaedic_instruments","stryker:specialty/cleaners-and-detergents","stryker:content-type/hcp_content"],"originallyPublished":null,"lastPublished":"2022-05-04T16:58:54.000Z","contentID":"D0000124158 Rev AA"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":null,"forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":["/content/dam/stryker/orthopaedic-instruments/products/speedspray62/images/Full-size.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/orthopaedic-instruments/products/speedspray62/images/Blu62.jpg"]},
"/us/en/orthopaedic-instruments/products/bpx": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"BPX","pageTitle":null,"description":"Discover the cordless solution helping you supercharge your extremity procedures. BPX’s design empowers you and helps minimize trip hazards and sterility concerns typically associated with power cords.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/orthopaedic-instruments/products/bpx/images/relatedproducts-thumbnail-bpx.png","imageAlt":"relatedproducts-thumbnail-bpx","tags":["stryker:product/orthopaedic_instruments/bpx","stryker:content-type/product","stryker:specialty/small-bone","stryker:content-type/hcp_content","stryker:business-unit/orthopaedic_instruments","stryker:portfolio/medical-and-surgical-equipment","stryker:capability/power-tools"],"originallyPublished":"2026-05-01T11:59:03.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-05-01T11:59:03.000Z","contentID":"OI-F1-SYK-2768917_REV-0"},"anchors":[{"id":"features","title":"Features and benefits","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"contact","title":"Contact us","hidden":false,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"products","title":"Related products","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"services","title":"Additional services","hidden":false,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"}],"disclaimer":"<p><b>Disclaimers</b></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>As compared to its predecessor (F1). Data on file. Review the IFU for more information about appropriate procedures.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Than its predecessor.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Pistol grip has 2.5 times the power of its predecessor.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Based on neutral anatomical position.</li>\r\n</ol>","forms":[{"formId":"3022","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you!","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[{"component":"customizable_copy","title":"Related products","items":[{"path":"/us/en/orthopaedic-instruments/products/tpx-hd","resolved":true,"title":"TPX HD","description":"Discover the comprehensive corded solution featuring both high- and low-speed burring and powerful torque, expanding whatˇs possible for total joint, extremities and high-speed cases. With specialized attachments, a full breadth of cutting accessories and a motor powerful enough to cut through metal and cement, TPX HD prepares you for everyday cases and challenging revisions.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/orthopaedic-instruments/products/tpx-hd/images/relatedproducts-thumbnail-tpxhd.jpg","alt":"relatedproducts-thumbnail-tpxhd"},{"path":"/us/en/portfolios/orthopaedics/foot-and-ankle","resolved":true,"title":"Foot and ankle","description":"As one of the world’s leading companies in medical technology, Stryker is dedicated to helping foot and ankle surgeons treat their patients more efficiently while enhancing patient care and the overall healthcare experience. Constantly driven to innovate, we offer a diverse array of advanced medical technologies and a comprehensive portfolio of products. We’re here for the foot and ankle surgeon. ","image":"/content/dam/stryker/foot-and-ankle/images/FA-foot-image.jpg","alt":"Foot and Ankle"}]}],"missingAlt":[]},
