"/us/en/sports-medicine/products/inspace": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"InSpace","pageTitle":"InSpace subacromial balloon spacer","description":"InSpace is the industry’s only minimally invasive biodegradable, subacromial balloon spacer for arthroscopic treatment of massive, irreparable rotator cuff tears (MIRCTs)†. ","image":"/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/IMG_0006_1.png","imageAlt":"InSpace subacromial balloon spacer","tags":["stryker:business-unit/sports-medicine","stryker:custom/sports-medicine/anatomy/shoulder","stryker:capability/sports-medicine","stryker:specialty/shoulder-sports-med","stryker:custom/sports-medicine/procedure-(shoulder)/massive-irreperable-rotator-cuff-tear","stryker:content-type/hcp_content","stryker:custom/sports-medicine/product-type/implant","stryker:content-type/product","stryker:product/sports-medicine/inspace","stryker:custom/sports-medicine/procedure/massive-irreperable-rotator-cuff-tear","stryker:portfolio/orthopaedics","stryker:system/sports-medicine","stryker:procedure/sports-medicine/rotator-cuff-repair"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T15:36:35.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-10-23T20:13:06.000Z","contentID":"1000903848 Rev. B"},"anchors":[{"id":"understanding-inspace","title":"Understanding InSpace","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"clinically-proven-results","title":"Clinically proven results","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"patient-selection","title":"Patient selection","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"inspace-surgical-technique","title":"Surgical technique","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"post-op-rehab","title":"Post-op and rehab","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"upcoming-events","title":"Upcoming events","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"economics-reimbursement","title":"Economics and reimbursement","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"patient-testimonials","title":"Patient testimonials","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"},{"id":"contact","title":"Contact us","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"customizablearea_parsys"}],"disclaimer":"<p>1. Verma N, Srikumaran U, Roden CM, Rogusky EJ, Lapner P, Neill H, Abboud JA. (2022). InSpace implant compared with partial repair for treatment of full-thickness massive rotator cuff tears<i>. J Bone Joint Surg Am.</i> Advance online publication. doi. 10.2106/JBJS.21.00667. http://ow.ly/wjSB50IRYym</p>\r\n<p>*A Stryker consultant</p>\r\n<p>† The InSpace™ subacromial tissue spacer system is indicated for the treatment of patients with massive, irreparable full-thickness torn rotator cuff tendons due to trauma or degradation with mild to moderate gleno-humeral osteoarthritis in patients greater than or equal to 65 years of age whose clinical conditions would benefit from treatment with a shorter surgical time compared to partial rotator cuff repair.</p>","forms":[{"formId":"3149","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you! We have received your request. A Stryker representative will be in contact with you soon.","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":["/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/surgtech-banner1.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/InSpace-in-cuff-fade-new.jpg","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/cpr-banner5.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/short-operative-time-icon.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/early-function-recovery-icon.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/early-pain-relief-icon.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/safe-and-effective-icon.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/Figure 1 .png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/Boxplot_graph.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/Boxplot_graph2.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/cpr-banner4.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/inspace-banner1.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/events-banner1.png","/content/dam/stryker/sports-medicine/products/inspace/images/reimbur-banner1.png"]},
