"/us/en/trauma-and-extremities/products/variax-2-clavicle-plating-system": {"template":"product-detail","metadata":{"title":"VariAx 2 Clavicle","pageTitle":"VariAx 2 Clavicle Variable Angle Locking Plating System","description":"The VariAx 2 Clavicle Plating System provides surgeons with a comprehensive range of anatomic plating options that work with a common instrument and screw platform. Plates utilize SmartLock technology which permits polyaxial screw placement. You can angle locking screws up to 15˚ in each direction for a total range of 30˚ providing you with the flexibility to position screws based on the patient's needs, not on the plate's pre-existing design.","image":"/content/dam/stryker/trauma-and-extremeties/products/variaxclavicle/images/clavicle-image.png","imageAlt":"VariAx Clavicle Variable Angle Locking Plating System","tags":["stryker:product/trauma-and-extremities/variax-clavicle","stryker:capability/upper-extremities","stryker:custom/trauma-and-extremities/product-type/plating","stryker:custom/trauma-and-extremities/Procedures/Fracture","stryker:system/trauma-and-extremities/plating","stryker:custom/trauma-and-extremities/Indications/shoulder","stryker:content-type/hcp_content","stryker:specialty/shoulder-and-elbow","stryker:specialty/shoulder","stryker:content-type/product","stryker:capability/trauma-and-extremities","stryker:portfolio/orthopaedics","stryker:system/trauma-and-extremities/variax-2","stryker:business-unit/trauma-and-extremities"],"originallyPublished":null,"lastPublished":"2023-02-22T20:07:03.000Z","contentID":"VAX-AWI-18, 12-2022"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p><b>References:</b></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>SOMA-BR-1, 09-2018</li>\r\n</ol>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[{"component":"customizable","title":null,"items":[{"path":"/us/en/trauma-and-extremities/products/VariAx2-Mini-Fragment-System","resolved":false},{"path":"/us/en/trauma-and-extremities/products/variax-2-elbow-plating-system","resolved":true,"title":"VariAx 2 Elbow","description":"The VariAx 2 Elbow variable angle locking plate system is designed for treatment of distal humeral and proximal ulnar fractures and provides you with a comprehensive range of anatomic plating options that work with a common instrument and screw platform. Plates utilize SmartLock technology which permits polyaxial screw placement. You can angle locking screws up to 15˚ in each direction for a total","image":"/content/dam/stryker/trauma-and-extremeties/products/variaxelbow/images/Variax-Elbow-Locking-Plate-System-image.png","alt":"VariAx 2 Elbow Locking Plate System"},{"path":"/us/en/trauma-and-extremities/products/variax-2-distal-radius-plating-system","resolved":false},{"path":"/us/en/trauma-and-extremities/products/variax-hand","resolved":true,"title":"Stryker Hand","description":"The Stryker Hand Plating module houses the VariAx Hand Locking and Profyle Hand Systems which offer the benefits of a comprehensive range of variable angled locking and non-locking plating options to treat fractures of bones of the hand and wrist. Plates utilize SmartLock Technology which permits polyaxial screw placement. You can angle locking screws up to 10 degrees in each direction for a total","image":"/content/dam/stryker/trauma-and-extremeties/products/variaxhand/images/Full.png","alt":"Stryker Hand Plating System"}]}],"missingAlt":[]},
